## Preamble

This document describes the WIN substrate as a machine. It does not derive the Standard Model line by line. Instead, it describes what the machine is, what it does, what it consumes, what it produces, and what is still unknown.

Every claim is labelled **[Proven]** or **[Open]**. Nothing is labelled "likely" or "probably." Either it has been demonstrated or it hasn't.

